{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01A5B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"从地图来看，到关押<R=FSLN,桑地诺民族解放阵线>司令官的小屋为止，沿途地形相当多变。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=FSLN,桑地诺民族解放阵线>","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"看来是这样。首先是丛林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这里适合避开敌人的视线前进，但相应地我们也更难发现敌人。小心点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"接下来是沿河的沼泽地。先仔细判断敌人的监视部署有多严密，再继续前进。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就这么办。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"最后是修船小屋。司令官就在这里。这里是敌人的重要据点，警备应该很严，也许得靠武力硬闯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"前面还有很长的路，一定要谨慎前进。别弄出太大的动静。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"}]}